<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 27 February <span class="n">5</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vasily-i-of-moscow"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vasily-i-of-moscow.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vasily I of Moscow</span><span class="tp">1371–1425</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pau-claris"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pau-claris.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pau Claris</span><span class="tp">1586–1641</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/chandra-shekhar-azad"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/chandra-shekhar-azad.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Chandra Shekhar Azad</span><span class="tp">1906–1931</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/kostis-palamas"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/kostis-palamas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Kostis Palamas</span><span class="tp">1859–1943</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/france-albert-rene"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/france-albert-rene.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">France-Albert René</span><span class="tp">1935–2019</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
